      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A double-blind trial comparing the analgesic efficacy of Suprofen 200 mg with aspirin 750 mg was carried out on 120 patients. There was no statistical difference between the two, though Suprofen had fewer side effects and could be used in circumstances where aspirin is contra-indicated."},
